# Make Commands

## Setup & Run
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make help` | Show help message |
| `make setup` | Run complete setup (venv + dependencies + Docker) |
| `make run` | Run the AI CLI |
| `make run-verbose` | Run the AI CLI in verbose mode |
| `make ui` | Start the AI CLI Web UI in background (detached, no logs) |
| `make ui-logs` | Start the AI CLI Web UI in foreground with logs |
| `make ui-stop` | Stop the AI CLI Web UI |

## Docker
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make up` | Start Docker containers (Ollama profile only) |
| `make up-redis` | Start Redis services (Redis + Redis API + Transformer) |
| `make up-all` | Start all Docker containers (Ollama + PostgreSQL + Redis + Transformer) |
| `make down` | Stop and remove Docker containers |

## Virtual Environment
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make venv` | Create Python virtual environment |

## Testing
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make test` | Run all tests (pytest + unit tests) |
| `make test-unit` | Run unit tests only (no container dependencies) |
| `make test-integration` | Run integration tests (requires containers) |
| `make test-spin` | Run spin_the_roulette tests (curl + fast pytest) |
| `make test-all` | Run all tests including slow tests |

## Miscellaneous
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make clean` | Remove virtual environment and Docker volumes |
| `make logs` | Show Docker container logs |
| `make status` | Show status of Docker containers |